; Expect: EntityTexture: the texture [0-9]+ does not exist
; A debug build (-d) stops EntityTexture with a texture that was freed. Other builds paint the entity with nothing.
If GetEnv$("BLITZLLVM_TEST_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("EntityTexture: the texture 1 does not exist (release build, not checked).")
tex = CreateTexture(8, 8, 1)
cube = CreateCube()
FreeTexture tex
EntityTexture cube, tex
Print "EntityTexture did not stop the program."
